1. Identify a vulnerable Drupal website.
A vulnerable Drupal website will have the following characteristics:
- It is running a version of Drupal that is affected by the Drupalgeddon2 vulnerability.
- It is not using the latest security patches.
- It is not using a web application firewall.
To check if a Drupal website is vulnerable, try visiting the following URL:
```
http://example.com/admin/content/node/0/edit
